<title>USA: Peoples Heritage Q3 shr rises with charge.</title>
<headline>Peoples Heritage Q3 shr rises with charge.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Maine 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.56		    $0.51</p>
<p> Net			 14,192		   12,789</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,191		   25,010</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.47		    $1.39</p>
<p> Net			 36,941		   34,060</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,163		   24,573</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 results include a one-time, after-tax charge of $1.2 million to replenish the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Excluding the charge, the company's 1996 Q3 earnings were $0.61 per share versus $0.53 per share in the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>Assets as of September 30, 1996, were $4.5 billion versus $4.0 billion as of September 30, 1995.</p>
<p>Deposits as of September 30, 1996, were $3.4 billion versus $3.2 billion as of September 30, 1995.</p>
<p>Full company name is Peoples Heritage Financial Group Inc</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
